#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
patch_extractor17.py   (edits scripts/step1_debate_text/extract_predications_v3.py; keeps a backup)

Replaces the functions that take a claim out of a parsed sentence (span_text through extract) with the rules worked
out on 1,380 real parsed sentences (outputs/audit/claim_rules_v17.txt says what each rule does). The rest of the
extractor (which sentences, the spaCy models, how files are written) does not change. fix15 is in the current
extractor; fix16 was never run and its rules are included here.
"""
